<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Full results for <span id="A1.SS1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LayRA</span></h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section provides comprehensive tables detailing the complete set of experimental results for all methods across all languages and evaluation tasks (XNLI: <a href="#A1.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ A.1 Full results for LayRA ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Continually Adding New Languages to Multilingual Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ A.1 Full results for LayRA ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Continually Adding New Languages to Multilingual Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>; PAWS-X: <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ A.1 Full results for LayRA ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Continually Adding New Languages to Multilingual Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, <a href="#A1.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ A.1 Full results for LayRA ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Continually Adding New Languages to Multilingual Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>; XCOPA: <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ A.1 Full results for LayRA ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Continually Adding New Languages to Multilingual Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, <a href="#A1.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ A.1 Full results for LayRA ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Continually Adding New Languages to Multilingual Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>, XStoryCloze: <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.1 Full results for LayRA ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Continually Adding New Languages to Multilingual Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, <a href="#A1.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ A.1 Full results for LayRA ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Continually Adding New Languages to Multilingual Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>). These results offer further evidence supporting the conclusions drawn in the main text §<a href="#S4" title="4 Results ‣ Continually Adding New Languages to Multilingual Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, allowing for deeper comparison and validation of performance metrics.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Performance of different CPT methods across languages for XNLI with Llama 3.1</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T3.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T3.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T3.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.25pt 3.0pt;"><span id="A1.T3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model</span></th>
<th id="A1.T3.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.25pt 3.0pt;"><span id="A1.T3.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">deu</span></th>
<th id="A1.T3.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.25pt 3.0pt;"><span id="A1.T3.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">eng</span></th>
