<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span><span id="A1.SS2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LayRA</span> layer selection ablation results</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here we present results for ablation studies done to find the best layer combinations for <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LayRA</span>. The tables in this section contain all the languages and tasks we evaluate our models on. The tables are also split up and expanded for easier comprehension.</p>
</div>
